WEBVTT

01:35.810 --> 01:40.880
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.590 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 32]

01:44.310 --> 01:45.509
If you want to kill me,

01:47.350 --> 01:48.479
I'll let you.

01:49.870 --> 01:52.150
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

01:52.660 --> 01:55.610
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

01:56.050 --> 01:58.150
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

01:58.940 --> 02:02.310
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

02:02.740 --> 02:04.810
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

02:03.150 --> 02:04.040
Feng Suige...

02:05.280 --> 02:08.460
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

02:05.680 --> 02:06.590
Look at me.

02:08.870 --> 02:09.590
Once, I was

02:09.160 --> 02:15.030
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

02:09.590 --> 02:11.390
the Red-Clad General of Jinxiu.

02:12.430 --> 02:14.520
Once, I was your mortal enemy.

02:15.000 --> 02:15.750
Once, I was

02:15.390 --> 02:17.380
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

02:15.750 --> 02:17.400
your most trusted partner.

02:18.000 --> 02:21.640
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

02:18.680 --> 02:19.360
Once...

02:21.240 --> 02:23.120
I was also your beloved.

02:22.070 --> 02:23.860
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

02:24.210 --> 02:27.980
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

02:25.400 --> 02:27.310
But whether then or now,

02:28.540 --> 02:30.410
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

02:29.240 --> 02:31.190
I've always been your Yixiao.

02:30.980 --> 02:34.060
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

02:34.520 --> 02:39.840
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

02:43.670 --> 02:46.590
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

02:50.380 --> 02:53.010
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

02:53.670 --> 02:56.570
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

02:57.060 --> 02:59.600
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

03:00.090 --> 03:02.770
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

03:01.310 --> 03:02.120
Why?

03:03.250 --> 03:05.960
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

03:04.800 --> 03:05.680
Why?

03:06.450 --> 03:09.210
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

03:09.790 --> 03:12.390
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

03:11.910 --> 03:12.870
I knew it.

03:13.040 --> 03:16.020
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

03:16.440 --> 03:21.850
♪ All I ask is to be together forever ♪

03:16.590 --> 03:17.430
I knew it.

03:18.520 --> 03:20.380
I still have a place in your heart.

03:21.000 --> 03:22.030
I once said,

03:22.630 --> 03:23.829
even if you forgot me,

03:25.190 --> 03:25.960
I'd find ways

03:25.960 --> 03:27.290
to make you remember me.

03:28.560 --> 03:29.190
You said

03:30.560 --> 03:32.030
if you truly forgot me,

03:34.360 --> 03:35.520
I could hit you

03:36.150 --> 03:36.910
or scold you—

03:38.520 --> 03:40.850
but I should never be disappointed in you,

03:41.630 --> 03:42.910
and I'd never leave you

03:42.910 --> 03:44.770
because of that disappointment.

03:45.310 --> 03:48.040
♪ If nothing said, then nothing heard;
if no will, then no us ♪

03:48.610 --> 03:51.270
♪ The moon is clear yet heartless ♪

03:51.760 --> 03:54.079
♪ No love, no longing;
no meeting, no missing ♪

03:54.750 --> 03:58.390
♪ With high mountains and long roads,
a life adrift ♪

04:10.360 --> 04:11.190
Relax.

04:12.590 --> 04:13.470
Breathe.

04:15.080 --> 04:16.630
Imagine you're holding

04:17.040 --> 04:18.040
a bow in your hand

04:18.510 --> 04:19.480
and an arrow.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.360
Clear your mind.

04:21.750 --> 04:22.880
Forget everything.

04:24.560 --> 04:25.430
Your arrow can fly

04:25.430 --> 04:26.560
wherever you wish.

04:29.270 --> 04:30.600
Where the arrow points,

04:30.720 --> 04:32.000
the heart follows.

04:33.159 --> 04:35.000
Where the arrow points,

04:35.680 --> 04:37.720
the heart follows.

04:38.800 --> 04:40.240
Where the arrow points,

04:41.240 --> 04:43.190
the heart follows.

04:45.270 --> 04:45.800
Yixiao,

04:46.270 --> 04:47.390
can you promise me

04:47.560 --> 04:49.070
that if one day I truly forget you,

04:49.070 --> 04:50.310
you can be angry with me,

04:50.310 --> 04:51.720
hit me, or scold me,

04:52.070 --> 04:53.950
but please don't be disappointed in me,

04:53.950 --> 04:55.040
and don't leave me

04:55.040 --> 04:56.510
because of that disappointment?

04:56.510 --> 04:57.800
Don't keep the hurt

04:58.430 --> 04:59.920
others caused you buried inside,

04:59.920 --> 05:01.920
and don't ever use it to hurt yourself.

05:01.920 --> 05:03.300
From now on, I'll protect you.

05:03.300 --> 05:05.270
I guarantee no one will ever
hurt you again.

05:05.270 --> 05:06.470
There's only one goal

05:06.830 --> 05:07.950
in my heart.

05:09.510 --> 05:10.310
What goal?

05:11.600 --> 05:12.870
In all the days to come

05:12.920 --> 05:14.410
that I can imagine,

05:15.390 --> 05:17.050
Yixiao is always there for me.

05:25.600 --> 05:27.680
I thought I'd lose you.

05:39.920 --> 05:41.180
I've always been here;

05:41.409 --> 05:42.370
I never left.

05:45.310 --> 05:46.070
I'll

05:47.270 --> 05:48.870
walk the road ahead with you.

05:52.720 --> 05:53.430
Okay.

06:25.600 --> 06:26.270
I said...

06:28.240 --> 06:30.040
let's consider it a fresh start.

06:31.560 --> 06:33.270
I believed in destined fate.

06:35.750 --> 06:37.280
We'd be just like before...

06:39.240 --> 06:40.000
meeting,

06:41.120 --> 06:42.050
falling in love,

06:44.159 --> 06:46.420
-staying together,
-Staying together,

06:47.000 --> 06:50.060
-standing by each other...
-standing by each other...

06:54.920 --> 06:56.560
and never

06:58.360 --> 07:00.220
-parting again.
-Parting again.

07:10.720 --> 07:11.560
Yixiao...

07:17.310 --> 07:17.920
Yixiao.

07:20.120 --> 07:21.180
I'm sorry, Yixiao.

07:23.560 --> 07:24.310
Yixiao.

07:24.870 --> 07:25.920
I remember now.

07:26.830 --> 07:27.560
Yixiao.

07:32.310 --> 07:33.070
I'm sorry.

07:34.510 --> 07:35.120
Yixiao.

07:36.000 --> 07:37.190
I remember now.

07:37.720 --> 07:38.600
I'm sorry.

07:40.440 --> 07:42.880
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

07:43.310 --> 07:47.510
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

07:46.510 --> 07:47.240
I'm sorry.

07:47.790 --> 07:49.330
♪ The light between your brows ♪

07:49.590 --> 07:51.350
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

07:51.690 --> 07:54.290
♪ That I love the most ♪

07:52.870 --> 07:53.870
It's all over now.

07:55.170 --> 07:57.510
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

07:55.680 --> 07:57.480
It's good that you remember now.

07:57.800 --> 07:58.950
That's good.

07:57.950 --> 08:02.050
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

08:02.280 --> 08:04.030
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

08:04.630 --> 08:08.700
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

08:09.620 --> 08:13.510
♪ Not in vain ♪

08:18.430 --> 08:20.160
That day, he asked me to put a book

08:20.160 --> 08:21.600
on the bottom shelf

08:21.600 --> 08:23.260
of the last row in the Library.

08:23.310 --> 08:24.070
He also said

08:24.070 --> 08:25.930
someone would come for it in time.

08:26.430 --> 08:27.920
But Xia Jingshi left Shengjing

08:27.920 --> 08:28.870
so many years ago,

08:28.870 --> 08:30.800
and Zhennan Pass is so far away.

08:31.390 --> 08:34.049
How could he have someone planted
in the palace?

08:34.240 --> 08:35.360
How about I help you

08:35.750 --> 08:36.510
catch the moles

08:36.510 --> 08:38.440
Xia Jingshi planted in the palace?

08:42.669 --> 08:43.720
You can do that?

08:43.870 --> 08:44.840
Dare to bet?

08:47.720 --> 08:49.120
Why are you staring at me?

08:49.630 --> 08:51.630
Although you've severed all ties
with Xia Jingshi,

08:51.630 --> 08:52.150
it seems

08:52.150 --> 08:53.630
there's no deep hatred between you two.

08:53.630 --> 08:55.830
Why are you suddenly so eager to help me?

08:56.550 --> 08:57.000
I really

08:57.000 --> 08:58.030
can't figure you out anymore...

08:58.030 --> 08:59.000
Are you in or not?

08:59.200 --> 08:59.750
I'm in.

09:00.030 --> 09:01.430
My current predicament,

09:01.790 --> 09:03.390
and my father's and brother's fates,

09:03.390 --> 09:04.850
all stem from Xia Jingshi.

09:05.200 --> 09:06.000
He must pay for

09:06.240 --> 09:07.600
this blood feud.

09:20.340 --> 09:22.450
[Rongyang Palace]

09:26.620 --> 09:28.030
[Imperial Kitchen]

09:46.050 --> 09:47.000
[Fuxin Pavilion]

09:47.160 --> 09:48.970
[Rongyang Palace]

10:08.710 --> 10:11.710
[Imperial Kitchen]

10:30.390 --> 10:31.190
Your Majesty.

10:32.240 --> 10:32.720
Why...

10:32.840 --> 10:33.770
Why are you here?

10:34.510 --> 10:35.390
Your Majesty ordered me to

10:35.390 --> 10:37.320
attend to Her Highness's daily needs.

10:37.320 --> 10:38.360
so I came specifically to check on

10:38.360 --> 10:39.160
today's meal.

11:14.150 --> 11:15.550
Where is the item inside?

11:18.000 --> 11:19.060
I don't understand

11:19.630 --> 11:21.090
what Your Highness means.

11:21.150 --> 11:22.410
You don't understand?

11:22.720 --> 11:23.550
I asked His Majesty to

11:23.550 --> 11:25.280
have Rongyang Hall surrounded

11:25.440 --> 11:26.550
precisely to prevent anyone

11:26.550 --> 11:28.080
from alerting Xia Jingshi.

11:28.390 --> 11:28.910
In desperation,

11:28.910 --> 11:30.510
that person would risk everything

11:30.510 --> 11:32.450
to get a message out,

11:32.750 --> 11:33.510
such as...

11:35.160 --> 11:37.310
hiding a secret message in the food.

11:44.050 --> 11:45.270
Whoever appears here

11:45.630 --> 11:47.000
is Xia Jingshi's spy.

11:49.420 --> 11:51.750
This servant has no grievances
with Your Highness.

11:51.750 --> 11:54.150
Why would Your Highness falsely accuse me?

11:59.840 --> 12:00.640
Your Majesty,

12:00.670 --> 12:01.800
I'm innocent.

12:01.930 --> 12:03.530
I'm innocent, Your Majesty!

12:09.630 --> 12:11.510
I wonder why Your Majesty

12:11.840 --> 12:13.240
summoned me so urgently.

12:14.360 --> 12:15.090
Bring him in.

12:43.600 --> 12:44.400
Your Majesty.

12:45.320 --> 12:46.850
What is the meaning of this?

12:50.510 --> 12:52.110
He's confessed everything.

12:52.120 --> 12:52.780
Confessed?

12:54.390 --> 12:55.520
I don't understand.

12:55.600 --> 12:56.440
He says he's the mole

12:56.440 --> 12:58.240
you planted by my side.

13:02.840 --> 13:03.500
Eunuch Bai,

13:04.150 --> 13:05.810
I have no grievances with you.

13:05.960 --> 13:07.220
Why frame me like this?

13:08.110 --> 13:09.710
This servant is innocent...

13:10.480 --> 13:12.480
This servant hasn't done anything.

13:12.490 --> 13:13.290
Your Majesty,

13:13.720 --> 13:14.920
this servant has been

13:15.000 --> 13:17.530
utterly loyal to you,
as heaven is my witness.

13:17.960 --> 13:19.420
This servant is innocent.

13:21.200 --> 13:21.840
Princess,

13:22.200 --> 13:23.200
look at those two—

13:23.440 --> 13:25.270
each one more convincing than the other.

13:25.270 --> 13:26.480
I caught them red-handed,

13:26.480 --> 13:28.140
and they're still denying it.

13:30.120 --> 13:33.320
They really won't admit it
until they're at death's door.

13:49.320 --> 13:50.050
Xia Jingshi.

13:51.720 --> 13:52.120
Don't blame me

13:52.120 --> 13:53.650
for not giving you a chance.

13:54.480 --> 13:55.390
If you admit now

13:55.390 --> 13:56.590
that he works for you,

13:56.790 --> 13:57.790
I can spare him

13:58.240 --> 13:59.700
and even return him to you.

13:59.870 --> 14:00.730
What do you say?

14:01.440 --> 14:02.150
Eunuch Bai and I

14:02.150 --> 14:03.600
barely know each other.

14:04.080 --> 14:06.880
I don't understand
what Your Majesty is implying.

14:09.630 --> 14:10.430
Bai Shouzhuo.

14:10.960 --> 14:11.790
I tried.

14:12.440 --> 14:14.240
See? Your master won't save you.

14:15.200 --> 14:16.120
In his heart,

14:17.120 --> 14:19.150
he only cares about himself.

14:37.670 --> 14:39.130
If he truly is not your man,

14:39.510 --> 14:40.240
kill him.

14:41.240 --> 14:42.000
Kill him,

14:42.360 --> 14:43.560
and I'll believe you.

15:01.720 --> 15:04.920
This servant has served in the palace
since childhood...

15:05.870 --> 15:08.270
and has always been
by Your Majesty's side,

15:08.840 --> 15:11.100
never harboring any disloyal thoughts.

15:12.480 --> 15:14.480
If Your Majesty doesn't believe me,

15:14.560 --> 15:15.960
then let this servant...

15:17.550 --> 15:19.240
prove my loyalty with my life!

15:58.670 --> 16:00.030
It seems this wretched servant

16:00.030 --> 16:01.360
truly isn't your spy.

16:02.390 --> 16:03.200
Of course not.

16:04.870 --> 16:06.000
But why do you

16:06.670 --> 16:08.510
seem somewhat saddened?

16:12.600 --> 16:13.580
Would you like to know

16:13.580 --> 16:14.400
who helped me

16:14.910 --> 16:16.570
catch this wretched servant?

16:16.960 --> 16:17.670
It was me.

16:32.280 --> 16:33.960
Eunuch Bai was only the beginning.

16:33.960 --> 16:34.670
I told you

16:35.440 --> 16:36.750
I'd make you regret it.

16:42.080 --> 16:42.810
Xia Jingshi,

16:42.910 --> 16:43.720
surprised?

16:47.620 --> 16:48.950
Didn't you want to play?

16:49.390 --> 16:51.250
I can play along with you forever.

16:53.720 --> 16:55.250
Your Majesty exaggerates.

16:56.200 --> 16:57.730
If there's nothing else...

16:59.620 --> 17:00.850
I'll take my leave.

17:02.150 --> 17:03.200
Xia Jingshi,

17:04.400 --> 17:07.660
the obsession and infatuation
I once felt for you are gone.

17:08.109 --> 17:09.000
From now on,

17:10.000 --> 17:11.640
you and I are enemies.

17:28.200 --> 17:31.400
This servant has served in the palace
since childhood...

17:31.440 --> 17:33.750
and has always been
by Your Majesty's side,

17:33.750 --> 17:36.010
never harboring any disloyal thoughts.

17:36.860 --> 17:38.860
If Your Majesty doesn't believe me,

17:38.960 --> 17:40.160
then let this servant

17:41.160 --> 17:42.960
prove my loyalty with my life!

17:57.640 --> 17:58.500
Your Highness.

18:00.790 --> 18:01.650
I never thought

18:02.200 --> 18:03.800
she would become so vicious.

18:04.510 --> 18:06.110
It's all my fault

18:07.510 --> 18:09.110
that she's become like this.

18:09.790 --> 18:10.790
Shouzhuo's death

18:12.070 --> 18:13.000
was my fault too.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.590
Your Highness, why blame yourself?

18:15.590 --> 18:16.720
It's not your fault.

18:17.920 --> 18:19.680
Feng Xiyang is no longer

18:19.680 --> 18:21.610
the Princess of Susha she once was.

18:21.680 --> 18:22.480
From now on...

18:23.960 --> 18:25.420
we have yet another enemy.

18:26.640 --> 18:28.440
Though she stayed by my side only briefly,

18:28.440 --> 18:29.960
she must have noticed

18:30.000 --> 18:31.660
something about our affairs.

18:31.790 --> 18:33.550
Should we have our men from the death camp

18:33.550 --> 18:34.680
prepare in advance?

18:37.110 --> 18:38.710
We mustn't rush this matter.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.830
First, we need to identify the guards

18:40.830 --> 18:41.830
placed by the Empress Dowager

18:41.830 --> 18:42.960
around Xia Jingyan,

18:43.720 --> 18:45.240
as well as the patrol routes

18:45.240 --> 18:47.350
of the Royal Guards
throughout the entire  palace.

18:47.350 --> 18:48.880
Our target is Xia Jingyan,

18:49.510 --> 18:51.440
and we need to walk away unscathed.

18:52.200 --> 18:53.530
We only have one chance.

19:04.270 --> 19:05.920
Father, Brother,

19:06.960 --> 19:07.830
do you know?

19:08.590 --> 19:09.920
I killed someone today.

19:11.440 --> 19:13.070
Though not by my own hand,

19:13.550 --> 19:14.880
he died because of me.

19:16.160 --> 19:16.960
The path I must walk

19:16.960 --> 19:18.760
has countless hardships ahead.

19:19.920 --> 19:20.960
In the past, you shielded me

19:20.960 --> 19:22.220
from these hardships.

19:22.590 --> 19:23.270
From now on,

19:24.110 --> 19:25.590
I must face them alone.

19:31.030 --> 19:32.400
I've lived for over 20 years,

19:32.400 --> 19:32.880
yet

19:32.880 --> 19:34.480
never have I been this happy.

19:34.880 --> 19:35.680
Just thinking about

19:35.680 --> 19:36.920
Xia Jingshi's look of defeat

19:36.920 --> 19:38.380
fills me with excitement!

19:40.740 --> 19:42.000
I really didn't expect

19:42.070 --> 19:43.680
that you're not only beautiful

19:43.680 --> 19:44.920
but also so clever.

19:45.550 --> 19:46.150
By the way,

19:46.350 --> 19:46.830
do you have

19:46.830 --> 19:47.690
any other ideas

19:48.070 --> 19:49.000
to help me root out

19:49.000 --> 19:50.440
more of Xia Jingshi's spies?

19:50.440 --> 19:52.040
I'll reward you generously.

19:53.000 --> 19:55.060
You seem to have forgotten our wager.

19:57.480 --> 19:58.830
A ruler's word is his bond.

19:58.830 --> 19:59.400
Tell me,

20:00.110 --> 20:01.040
what do you want?

20:03.720 --> 20:05.720
Kill Murong Zhong and his son for me.

20:12.110 --> 20:13.710
You've finally come around!

20:15.350 --> 20:17.410
I'm growing more and more fond of you.

20:17.550 --> 20:18.150
Very well.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.000
It's a deal.

20:27.720 --> 20:29.310
What if he hadn't remembered you?

20:29.310 --> 20:31.200
Would you really let him kill you?

20:32.060 --> 20:34.260
Even if I had died, I wouldn't regret it.

20:35.240 --> 20:37.390
You poor star-crossed lovers

20:37.440 --> 20:39.270
truly have been through so much hardship.

20:39.270 --> 20:40.960
Even Heaven wants to help you.

20:42.720 --> 20:44.580
I must thank you for that, Lady An.

20:45.030 --> 20:46.590
I heard from Ling Feng

20:46.680 --> 20:48.550
that you also lost your memory once.

20:48.550 --> 20:49.590
How are you now?

20:50.160 --> 20:51.110
Let me check.

20:54.440 --> 20:55.310
I've now recovered

20:55.310 --> 20:57.310
almost all of my previous memories.

20:57.400 --> 20:58.270
My injured left arm

20:58.270 --> 20:59.870
has almost fully healed too.

20:59.920 --> 21:00.400
Although

21:00.400 --> 21:01.590
Lord Ling previously cautioned me

21:01.590 --> 21:02.550
not to draw a strong bow,

21:02.550 --> 21:03.800
I can feel

21:04.030 --> 21:05.760
that it's fully recovered now.

21:06.510 --> 21:09.140
Your pulse shows you've indeed recovered.

21:09.550 --> 21:10.510
Now, Feng Suige has also

21:10.510 --> 21:11.880
overcome a difficult period.

21:11.880 --> 21:12.750
So what do you plan

21:12.750 --> 21:13.840
to do next?

21:14.680 --> 21:16.310
Let him rest quietly for a few more days.

21:16.310 --> 21:17.370
After that,

21:17.480 --> 21:18.280
we will leave.

21:18.590 --> 21:19.310
Leave?

21:19.830 --> 21:20.240
Yes.

21:20.720 --> 21:22.450
We still have many things to do.

21:30.750 --> 21:31.610
Your Highness,

21:31.680 --> 21:32.960
when your life

21:32.960 --> 21:34.160
hung by a thread,

21:34.160 --> 21:35.510
I didn't dare to leave your side,

21:35.510 --> 21:36.270
so I had no time to look for

21:36.270 --> 21:38.000
Gu Yu, Yun Fang, and the others.

21:38.000 --> 21:39.480
That day when we left Yujing City,

21:39.480 --> 21:40.440
they stayed behind
and held back the pursuers,

21:40.440 --> 21:42.270
and there's been no news of them since.

21:42.270 --> 21:43.750
Their fates are uncertain.

21:43.750 --> 21:45.080
I'm worried about them.

21:45.640 --> 21:47.270
Go quickly and find their whereabouts.

21:47.270 --> 21:47.750
But...

21:48.880 --> 21:50.340
Don't worry, I'll be fine.

21:50.830 --> 21:51.400
You must

21:51.400 --> 21:52.640
also take care of yourself.

21:52.640 --> 21:53.170
Alright.

21:53.440 --> 21:55.370
Please be careful, Your Highness.

22:00.030 --> 22:00.960
How is she doing?

22:01.160 --> 22:02.020
She's fine now.

22:03.540 --> 22:04.600
Where's Ling Feng?

22:04.960 --> 22:05.540
He left,

22:05.590 --> 22:06.400
saying he was going to

22:06.400 --> 22:08.480
discuss matters
with the elder of the Storm Alliance.

22:08.480 --> 22:09.680
Then I'll go find him.

22:24.510 --> 22:25.170
How are you?

22:25.970 --> 22:27.100
Does the wound hurt?

22:28.920 --> 22:29.850
It doesn't hurt.

22:34.680 --> 22:36.010
It really doesn't hurt.

22:43.960 --> 22:44.560
I'm sorry.

22:46.720 --> 22:48.450
You've suffered because of me.

22:51.750 --> 22:52.960
Lu Ke told me everything

22:52.960 --> 22:54.550
that happened after I fell unconscious

22:54.550 --> 22:56.810
from the Golden Acupuncture treatment.

22:56.920 --> 22:58.180
It's all behind us now.

22:59.480 --> 23:00.880
I completely understand

23:01.790 --> 23:02.720
how you feel now.

23:06.400 --> 23:07.110
I still remember

23:07.110 --> 23:08.970
the last words I said to my father,

23:09.960 --> 23:11.270
every single one.

23:12.790 --> 23:14.750
I said that the father-son bond

23:15.590 --> 23:17.640
and the ruler-subject loyalty between us

23:17.640 --> 23:19.500
were severed from that moment on.

23:24.720 --> 23:26.580
You don't need to blame yourself.

23:26.750 --> 23:27.880
Who could have known

23:28.400 --> 23:30.600
those would be your last words with him?

23:30.790 --> 23:32.590
I know you're eager for revenge.

23:33.720 --> 23:34.980
But you must stay calm.

23:36.030 --> 23:37.630
You've only just recovered.

23:37.920 --> 23:39.520
The most important thing now

23:40.070 --> 23:41.130
is your own safety.

23:42.790 --> 23:43.520
Don't worry.

23:44.100 --> 23:44.750
My injuries

23:44.750 --> 23:45.880
have mostly healed.

23:46.790 --> 23:48.070
Compared to revenge, what's more important

23:48.070 --> 23:49.510
to me is your safety.

23:52.590 --> 23:53.390
And Xiyang's.

23:56.160 --> 23:58.560
After Xiyang left,
I was worried about her,

23:58.640 --> 24:00.840
so I sent people to gather information.

24:00.960 --> 24:02.030
She should be

24:02.030 --> 24:04.640
living with Xia Jingshi
in Rongyang Palace by now.

24:04.640 --> 24:05.440
When my father

24:05.440 --> 24:06.770
and I were still around,

24:07.110 --> 24:08.970
Jinxiu still had some restraint.

24:10.000 --> 24:12.480
But now that everything has changed
in Susha,

24:12.480 --> 24:14.880
her situation must be even more difficult.

24:18.880 --> 24:21.080
And I know my sister better than anyone.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.850
Though she appears gentle,

24:22.850 --> 24:24.350
she's actually strong-willed.

24:24.350 --> 24:26.810
She's been strong-minded since childhood.

24:26.960 --> 24:28.300
No matter what others say,

24:28.300 --> 24:29.830
she will firmly believe

24:30.310 --> 24:32.470
that I could never commit regicide.

24:33.720 --> 24:34.310
Suige,

24:35.200 --> 24:35.680
I don't believe

24:35.680 --> 24:37.200
you would die so easily.

24:38.310 --> 24:39.970
I believe I will see you again.

24:40.640 --> 24:42.220
Before we meet,

24:42.790 --> 24:44.450
I will definitely avenge you.

24:45.310 --> 24:46.750
You are the most

24:46.750 --> 24:48.350
important people in my life.

24:48.550 --> 24:49.750
I'd rather lose my life

24:49.750 --> 24:51.160
than lose either of you.

24:52.110 --> 24:53.240
You won't lose us.

24:54.750 --> 24:56.410
I'll always stay by your side.

25:06.640 --> 25:07.310
Yixiao!

25:09.160 --> 25:09.750
Come in!

25:20.960 --> 25:22.270
I just ran into Lady An.

25:22.680 --> 25:23.280
She told me

25:23.880 --> 25:25.340
he's regained his memory.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.720
Actually, it's nothing important.

25:29.720 --> 25:30.400
Then I'll just take...

25:30.400 --> 25:30.930
Ning Fei.

25:32.830 --> 25:33.430
Thank you.

25:34.200 --> 25:35.200
During this time,

25:35.680 --> 25:37.030
he's also been very concerned about you

25:37.030 --> 25:38.560
and has helped a great deal.

25:42.110 --> 25:42.680
That day,

25:43.440 --> 25:45.700
I accidentally revealed your identity.

25:46.200 --> 25:46.880
I've always wanted to

25:46.880 --> 25:48.410
apologize to you in person.

25:48.550 --> 25:49.160
It's fine.

25:49.720 --> 25:50.850
It's all in the past.

25:53.070 --> 25:53.670
All right.

25:54.160 --> 25:55.290
Then let bygones...

25:56.820 --> 25:57.810
be bygones.

25:58.590 --> 25:59.530
I'm a simple man.

26:00.160 --> 26:01.490
I'm not good with words.

26:02.270 --> 26:03.380
Let's just say

26:04.310 --> 26:05.790
that the old Ning Fei is dead.

26:05.790 --> 26:06.850
Yixiao is my buddy.

26:07.590 --> 26:08.390
From now on...

26:09.590 --> 26:11.250
I'll treat you as my buddy too.

26:12.030 --> 26:12.760
That's good.

26:13.750 --> 26:15.360
I've mostly recovered.

26:15.510 --> 26:16.840
We'll be leaving here soon.

26:16.840 --> 26:18.300
Do you want to come with us?

26:20.110 --> 26:21.110
You're leaving?

26:22.070 --> 26:22.590
Don't you

26:22.590 --> 26:23.790
know the rules here?

26:25.270 --> 26:26.240
Rules are rules.

26:26.240 --> 26:27.470
There can't be any exceptions!

26:26.340 --> 26:29.180
[Storm Alliance]

26:27.790 --> 26:28.270
Especially not

26:28.270 --> 26:29.450
for a few outsiders.

26:29.510 --> 26:30.070
They never said

26:30.070 --> 26:31.310
they wanted to join the Storm Alliance!

26:31.310 --> 26:32.270
Don't play dumb with me.

26:32.270 --> 26:33.510
Don't you know the rules here?

26:33.510 --> 26:35.110
Once you enter the Storm Alliance,

26:35.110 --> 26:36.310
you become a member of the alliance!

26:36.310 --> 26:37.640
You may never betray it!

26:38.200 --> 26:40.410
Not betraying the alliance
means you cannot leave.

26:40.410 --> 26:41.270
You must stay here

26:41.270 --> 26:42.730
for the rest of your lives.

26:42.830 --> 26:44.110
If you insist on leaving,

26:44.110 --> 26:44.480
then you're

26:44.480 --> 26:46.680
making an enemy of the entire alliance!

26:46.790 --> 26:47.460
Of course,

26:47.550 --> 26:48.490
except for me.

26:49.310 --> 26:50.480
At that time, I was so anxious

26:50.480 --> 26:51.480
to save Feng Suige

26:51.850 --> 26:52.510
that I forgot about

26:52.510 --> 26:53.590
the rules Lord Ling mentioned

26:53.590 --> 26:55.200
when I brought you here.

26:55.720 --> 26:57.440
I only learned after I was saved

26:57.440 --> 26:59.440
that you staked your life to save me.

27:00.720 --> 27:02.180
If I leave the alliance,

27:02.270 --> 27:04.000
you'll bear all consequences.

27:04.310 --> 27:05.930
I'll bear whatever consequences there are!

27:05.930 --> 27:10.180
[Storm Alliance]

27:06.030 --> 27:07.110
There was a life at stake.

27:07.110 --> 27:07.720
At that time,

27:07.720 --> 27:08.750
to save Feng Suige's life,

27:08.750 --> 27:10.440
I couldn't care about all your rules!

27:10.440 --> 27:11.270
No matter what you say,

27:11.270 --> 27:12.300
he cannot leave!

27:13.000 --> 27:14.640
If you don't agree to my rules,

27:14.640 --> 27:16.440
then you shouldn't have accepted
our treatment!

27:16.440 --> 27:17.570
Who is Feng Suige?

27:17.680 --> 27:19.030
Do you think he'll follow
your alliance rules?

27:19.030 --> 27:20.350
Besides, he carries a deep blood feud!

27:20.350 --> 27:20.880
He will definitely

27:20.880 --> 27:22.210
carve a bloody path out!

27:22.720 --> 27:23.400
How?

27:23.920 --> 27:25.350
There are only a few of you.

27:25.350 --> 27:27.000
How many people does the alliance have?

27:27.000 --> 27:28.310
Even if you could take on hundreds of men,

27:28.310 --> 27:30.000
you still couldn't defeat them all.

27:30.000 --> 27:31.460
There will always be a way.

27:31.480 --> 27:32.920
If the power gap is too great,

27:32.920 --> 27:34.780
then we'll find other solutions.

27:36.030 --> 27:36.950
He's right.

27:37.510 --> 27:38.390
Don't worry.

27:38.640 --> 27:39.350
I remember Lord Ling

27:39.350 --> 27:40.310
specifically instructed

27:40.310 --> 27:41.310
the people who brought you here

27:41.310 --> 27:42.830
that they must be blindfolded.

27:42.830 --> 27:43.440
I suppose

27:43.920 --> 27:45.400
the reason no one is allowed to leave

27:45.400 --> 27:45.960
is that they don't want

27:45.960 --> 27:48.000
the alliance's location to be revealed.

27:48.000 --> 27:49.000
If we swear

27:49.110 --> 27:49.830
never to disclose

27:49.830 --> 27:51.030
the secrets of this place,

27:51.030 --> 27:52.760
perhaps there will be a way out.

27:53.030 --> 27:53.790
I don't trust a word

27:53.790 --> 27:54.850
of the Fengs' oath!

27:54.960 --> 27:57.070
Saving him was already
more than generous of me!

27:57.070 --> 27:57.640
Just tell me,

27:57.640 --> 27:58.750
what would make you compromise?

27:58.750 --> 27:59.350
I can't!

27:59.460 --> 28:03.350
[Storm Alliance]

27:59.640 --> 28:00.270
I only agreed

28:00.270 --> 28:01.200
to save his life.

28:01.200 --> 28:01.680
But I never said

28:01.680 --> 28:02.640
our feud with the Feng family

28:02.640 --> 28:03.750
would be wiped clean!

28:03.750 --> 28:04.200
You...

28:05.790 --> 28:07.320
His father is already dead!

28:07.510 --> 28:08.590
Holding the previous generation's

28:08.590 --> 28:09.980
grudge against him—

28:10.240 --> 28:11.300
isn't that unfair?

28:12.350 --> 28:13.550
The son pays for the father's debts.

28:13.550 --> 28:15.000
It's the natural order of things.

28:15.000 --> 28:16.940
What if I add my personal request?

28:17.960 --> 28:19.760
You're speaking up for them too?

28:20.440 --> 28:21.160
Where there are rules,

28:21.160 --> 28:23.150
there are ways around them.

28:23.270 --> 28:24.400
Ling Feng and his daughter

28:24.400 --> 28:25.920
aren't bound by the alliance covenant.

28:25.920 --> 28:27.520
I also come and go as I please.

28:27.640 --> 28:29.430
Otherwise, let those two

28:29.510 --> 28:31.070
either join Zhengnian Villa

28:31.070 --> 28:32.600
or become my disciples.

28:32.750 --> 28:33.640
That works too.

28:33.640 --> 28:34.240
Good idea.

28:34.590 --> 28:35.160
Lei,

28:35.310 --> 28:36.750
aren't you just afraid someone will reveal

28:36.750 --> 28:37.920
the location of the alliance?

28:37.920 --> 28:39.350
How about this—Lady An and I
will be their guarantors!

28:39.350 --> 28:40.440
That should be enough, right?

28:40.440 --> 28:41.240
Both of you

28:41.240 --> 28:42.920
have saved our alliance before.

28:42.920 --> 28:44.270
You are friends of our alliance.

28:44.270 --> 28:44.880
I've always

28:44.880 --> 28:46.030
regarded you as honored guests,

28:46.030 --> 28:47.440
which is why I'm accommodating you.

28:47.440 --> 28:48.960
But that's not enough
to make an exception for them!

28:48.960 --> 28:50.960
Then I must make something clear first.

28:50.960 --> 28:52.550
That girl, Yixiao, has spirit.

28:52.550 --> 28:53.330
I like her.

28:53.480 --> 28:55.640
I'm also the one who cured Feng Suige,

28:55.680 --> 28:56.510
and that's fate.

28:56.510 --> 28:58.440
If there's any conflict in the future,

28:58.440 --> 28:59.700
you must not harm them!

28:59.750 --> 29:00.790
Otherwise,

29:00.920 --> 29:02.180
I will be very angry!

29:02.480 --> 29:03.310
Calm down, calm down.

29:03.310 --> 29:03.920
Get off me!

29:13.310 --> 29:13.970
Godfather,

29:14.200 --> 29:14.750
Feng Suige's man

29:14.750 --> 29:15.680
tried to leave this place.

29:15.680 --> 29:16.310
The Woodcutter Branch members captured him

29:16.310 --> 29:17.310
and brought him back.

29:17.310 --> 29:18.480
How should we deal with him?

29:18.480 --> 29:19.240
Is it Lu Ke?

29:24.310 --> 29:26.910
Deal with him
according to our alliance rules!

29:27.000 --> 29:28.630
This matter requires
careful consideration.

29:28.630 --> 29:29.760
We can't act rashly.

29:30.880 --> 29:32.740
Well, since there's this rule...

29:33.750 --> 29:34.640
it seems that Lu Ke won't be able to leave

29:34.640 --> 29:36.040
even if I send him outside

29:36.270 --> 29:37.400
to look for our men.

29:38.530 --> 29:39.550
Elder Lei's Woodcutter Branch is

29:39.550 --> 29:41.640
specifically responsible for
the alliance's patrol—

29:41.640 --> 29:42.750
keeping out enemies

29:42.750 --> 29:43.880
and preventing alliance members

29:43.880 --> 29:45.200
from leaving without permission.

29:45.200 --> 29:45.800
I'm afraid

29:46.310 --> 29:47.710
Lu Ke might be in trouble.

29:49.550 --> 29:50.070
Sister!

29:50.720 --> 29:51.200
Sister.

29:51.720 --> 29:52.240
Sister.

29:53.030 --> 29:54.090
Lu Ke is in trouble.

29:57.510 --> 29:57.880
Six!

29:58.960 --> 29:59.440
Seven!

30:00.680 --> 30:01.080
Eight!

30:02.480 --> 30:02.880
Nine!

30:04.240 --> 30:04.680
Ten!

30:06.110 --> 30:06.590
Eleven!

30:07.830 --> 30:08.290
Twelve!

30:09.480 --> 30:10.080
Thirteen!

30:11.270 --> 30:11.750
You guys are serious?

30:11.750 --> 30:12.350
Fourteen!

30:13.790 --> 30:14.320
Fifteen!

30:15.400 --> 30:15.930
Sixteen!

30:17.550 --> 30:18.210
Seventeen!

30:19.720 --> 30:20.320
Eighteen!

30:22.110 --> 30:22.880
Nineteen!

30:23.720 --> 30:24.350
Twenty!

30:26.110 --> 30:26.680
Stop!

30:30.200 --> 30:30.790
Your Highness...

30:30.790 --> 30:31.310
Lu Ke.

30:31.680 --> 30:33.080
I'm fine, Your Highness.

30:33.230 --> 30:34.090
Not hurt at all.

30:34.960 --> 30:35.750
It's nothing.

30:35.750 --> 30:36.680
I'm really fine.

30:41.680 --> 30:43.310
Why did you hurt my man?

30:44.200 --> 30:45.760
He left this place without permission.

30:45.760 --> 30:48.440
According to our alliance rules,
he must be whipped—

30:48.440 --> 30:49.110
50 lashes.

30:50.000 --> 30:51.600
We're only halfway through.

30:53.310 --> 30:54.010
Elder Lei,

30:54.240 --> 30:54.990
we came here

30:55.070 --> 30:56.590
in a hurry seeking medical help.

30:56.590 --> 30:57.310
It was careless of us

30:57.310 --> 30:58.570
to violate your rules.

30:58.920 --> 31:00.030
We sincerely apologize.

31:00.030 --> 31:01.310
Since this is our first offense,

31:01.310 --> 31:02.350
could you please show some leniency?

31:02.350 --> 31:04.590
Only by enforcing punishment
according to alliance rules

31:04.590 --> 31:06.390
will you remember more clearly.

31:06.550 --> 31:08.030
May I ask who made

31:08.920 --> 31:10.310
these rules you speak of?

31:10.310 --> 31:11.970
That's none of your business.

31:14.640 --> 31:15.670
Y-Your Highness,

31:15.960 --> 31:17.790
considering the Storm Alliance
has helped us,

31:17.790 --> 31:18.920
I didn't fight them.

31:19.270 --> 31:20.200
They brought me back here.

31:20.200 --> 31:22.240
-They're actually serious about this...
-Lu Ke!

31:22.240 --> 31:22.920
Keep quiet.

31:32.350 --> 31:32.960
Elder Lei,

31:33.440 --> 31:35.590
your alliance saved my life.

31:36.110 --> 31:37.440
I'll never forget that.

31:37.750 --> 31:39.440
But Lu Ke is my man,

31:39.830 --> 31:41.200
and I sent him out.

31:41.350 --> 31:43.480
His affairs are naturally my concern.

31:43.880 --> 31:44.940
The Storm Alliance

31:45.110 --> 31:46.550
was founded by my mother.

31:47.240 --> 31:47.880
I don't believe

31:47.880 --> 31:50.140
she'd establish such rules as flogging.

31:50.310 --> 31:51.110
That's right.

31:51.720 --> 31:53.650
Your mother never set these rules.

31:53.830 --> 31:55.160
If you have resentment,

31:55.240 --> 31:55.880
then blame your father,

31:55.880 --> 31:57.250
who's now in his grave.

31:57.590 --> 32:00.120
He was the one
who tried to exterminate us all.

32:00.350 --> 32:01.480
And now you have the nerve to ask

32:01.480 --> 32:03.140
why people here cannot leave?

32:04.070 --> 32:05.130
Listen carefully:

32:05.480 --> 32:07.720
it's precisely because someone once left

32:07.720 --> 32:09.450
and led your Susha's army here.

32:09.590 --> 32:11.440
This place was nearly razed to the ground!

32:11.440 --> 32:13.300
Anyone can question these rules,

32:13.880 --> 32:15.280
except your Feng family.

32:16.000 --> 32:17.930
You have no right to question them.

32:24.740 --> 32:25.450
Elder Lei,

32:25.710 --> 32:26.720
as I said before,

32:27.000 --> 32:28.480
it might not have been
Feng Pingcheng who ordered

32:28.480 --> 32:29.790
the attack on the alliance.

32:29.790 --> 32:31.450
This matter is still unclear,

32:31.480 --> 32:32.720
so it's premature

32:32.720 --> 32:34.050
to pin this blood feud

32:34.350 --> 32:35.380
on Feng Suige.

32:35.640 --> 32:37.640
As the Commander-in-Chief
of all Susha armies,

32:37.640 --> 32:38.720
I've reviewed all military intelligence

32:38.720 --> 32:41.110
and battle reports since Susha's founding.

32:41.110 --> 32:42.510
Yet I've never seen any record
of Susha troops

32:42.510 --> 32:44.640
being deployed against the alliance.

32:45.050 --> 32:47.270
If my father had truly given
such an order,

32:47.270 --> 32:47.680
there would

32:47.680 --> 32:49.280
definitely be a record of it.

32:49.640 --> 32:51.560
What are you implying?

32:51.920 --> 32:53.640
The one who ordered the siege against you

32:53.640 --> 32:55.040
was likely someone else.

32:56.160 --> 32:57.640
You've harbored this hatred
for so many years,

32:57.640 --> 33:00.500
but I'm afraid you've been hating
the wrong person.

33:07.920 --> 33:10.180
Since you insist on following the rules,

33:10.270 --> 33:12.100
and Lu Ke acted under my orders,

33:12.240 --> 33:13.030
I should be the one

33:13.030 --> 33:14.680
to receive the punishment on his behalf.

33:14.680 --> 33:15.200
No!

33:15.480 --> 33:16.880
Don't you dare do that!

33:17.680 --> 33:18.650
Lei,

33:18.960 --> 33:20.880
these youngsters don't know the rules.

33:20.880 --> 33:21.750
You've already punished him.

33:21.750 --> 33:24.010
Let it go since it's their first offense.

33:25.400 --> 33:25.960
Suige.

33:26.680 --> 33:28.960
Elder Lei is a respected senior, after all.

33:28.960 --> 33:29.750
If you apologize,

33:29.750 --> 33:31.000
he'll let it go.

33:31.680 --> 33:33.340
Let's discuss leaving later.

33:34.310 --> 33:35.920
Only those who have done wrong need
to apologize.

33:35.920 --> 33:37.180
What have I done wrong?

33:39.000 --> 33:39.640
Elder Lei,

33:40.720 --> 33:41.350
we will

33:41.790 --> 33:43.450
definitely leave this place.

33:44.440 --> 33:45.200
Good.

33:46.350 --> 33:47.590
I'd like to see

33:47.640 --> 33:49.030
how you leave.

33:50.160 --> 33:52.160
Today, out of respect for Ling Feng,

33:52.270 --> 33:53.730
I'll let you off this time.

33:53.920 --> 33:55.160
If it happens again,

33:55.310 --> 33:56.370
I'll show no mercy!

33:57.110 --> 33:57.880
Feng Suige,

33:58.640 --> 34:01.000
the feud between us is not yet settled.

34:02.240 --> 34:04.110
I'll make you pay for

34:04.110 --> 34:05.510
every single one of them.

34:15.850 --> 34:20.560
[Yinghua Palace]

34:18.920 --> 34:20.840
On the day
the late Emperor was assassinated,

34:20.840 --> 34:22.920
Eunuch Ma and the Jinwu Guards on duty

34:22.920 --> 34:24.920
were all killed by the First Prince.

34:25.030 --> 34:26.480
The only witnesses to

34:26.480 --> 34:27.920
the First Prince's regicide

34:27.920 --> 34:29.230
were the Prince of Han

34:29.230 --> 34:30.920
and the Commandery Prince of Yishu.

34:30.920 --> 34:31.719
Your Majesty,

34:31.760 --> 34:33.960
please stop putting me
in a difficult position.

34:33.960 --> 34:34.440
Even if I had

34:34.440 --> 34:35.800
the courage of a lion,

34:35.800 --> 34:37.550
I wouldn't dare ask
the Prince of Han to verify

34:37.550 --> 34:39.630
-the assassination of the late Emperor...
-You mean...

34:39.630 --> 34:41.760
my brother alone, with just one sword,

34:42.070 --> 34:43.909
killed all the Jinwu Guards?

34:44.230 --> 34:45.710
The First Prince was valiant
and skilled in battle,

34:45.710 --> 34:46.590
capable of extraordinary feats.

34:46.590 --> 34:47.190
It's not

34:47.190 --> 34:48.230
entirely impossible.

34:48.230 --> 34:50.510
What about the Imperial Guards
who were patrolling the palace that day?

34:50.510 --> 34:52.000
When my brother fought
with the Jinwu Guards,

34:52.000 --> 34:53.110
there must have been such a commotion—

34:53.110 --> 34:53.960
the Imperial Guards couldn't possibly

34:53.960 --> 34:54.820
have missed it.

34:59.440 --> 35:00.280
It seems

35:00.920 --> 35:03.110
the Imperial Guards were all redeployed.

35:03.110 --> 35:04.000
Redeployed?

35:05.800 --> 35:06.550
By whom?

35:06.840 --> 35:07.880
Why were they moved?

35:07.880 --> 35:08.510
I'm foolish,

35:08.510 --> 35:10.280
and I simply couldn't find out.

35:13.190 --> 35:14.110
Then tell me,

35:14.710 --> 35:17.770
who has the authority to
redeploy the Imperial Guards?

35:20.110 --> 35:20.910
Your Majesty,

35:21.030 --> 35:22.670
please stop asking these questions.

35:22.670 --> 35:23.850
If you continue,

35:24.440 --> 35:27.140
my head might not remain on my shoulders.

35:27.190 --> 35:28.850
What if I command you to speak?

35:30.150 --> 35:31.920
On the day the late Emperor
returned to the palace,

35:31.920 --> 35:33.050
he ordered Eunuch Ma

35:33.070 --> 35:35.030
to discipline the Imperial Guards.

35:35.030 --> 35:38.030
Those in the palace who can command
the Imperial Guards

35:38.030 --> 35:39.490
can be counted on one hand.

35:40.230 --> 35:41.760
Very few people...

35:44.230 --> 35:46.560
Other than the Murong family, the only one

35:47.510 --> 35:49.570
who can mobilize the Imperial Guards

35:49.710 --> 35:51.640
is my mother, the Empress Dowager,

35:52.150 --> 35:52.730
right?

35:53.260 --> 35:54.760
This subject never said such a thing!

35:54.760 --> 35:56.070
This subject knows nothing about this!

35:56.070 --> 35:58.000
This subject truly knows nothing!

36:05.670 --> 36:07.790
You're also speaking up for Feng Suige?

36:07.790 --> 36:12.370
[Storm Alliance]

36:08.440 --> 36:10.230
He only came here seeking medical help.

36:10.230 --> 36:10.800
If we

36:10.800 --> 36:12.590
forcibly keep him in the alliance,

36:12.590 --> 36:13.550
he will certainly

36:13.550 --> 36:14.590
do everything in his power

36:14.590 --> 36:15.460
to leave.

36:15.590 --> 36:17.320
Still, we cannot let him leave!

36:17.510 --> 36:18.800
That's how I see it.

36:18.920 --> 36:19.840
Our Storm Alliance is

36:19.700 --> 36:23.290
[Storm Alliance]

36:20.000 --> 36:21.730
a shelter for all under heaven,

36:21.920 --> 36:23.110
not a prison!

36:23.590 --> 36:25.190
But every rule established

36:25.190 --> 36:26.530
has its reason.

36:26.710 --> 36:28.310
Not allowing people to leave

36:28.550 --> 36:30.320
is also to protect our alliance.

36:30.320 --> 36:31.960
It's precisely because every one of us
follows the rules

36:31.960 --> 36:33.620
that we remain safe and sound!

36:33.800 --> 36:34.460
Say no more.

36:35.630 --> 36:37.560
Feng Suige cannot be an exception.

36:38.230 --> 36:39.000
Otherwise, in the future,

36:39.000 --> 36:41.660
wouldn't anyone be able to leave
as they please?

36:53.230 --> 36:54.230
Your Highness...

36:55.030 --> 36:55.890
Your Highness,

36:56.030 --> 36:57.160
please don't worry.

36:57.360 --> 36:58.710
After years of
fighting through life and death,

36:58.710 --> 36:59.800
I've suffered all sorts of injuries.

36:59.800 --> 37:02.030
This little injury is
like a mosquito bite.

37:02.030 --> 37:02.550
Lord Ling

37:02.550 --> 37:04.030
doesn't even bother to come treat me.

37:04.030 --> 37:05.670
It'll heal in a couple of days.

37:05.670 --> 37:06.920
All right, hush now.

37:07.800 --> 37:08.360
Okay.

37:11.510 --> 37:13.110
You've been here for so long.

37:13.280 --> 37:15.280
Have you ever tried to leave before?

37:16.440 --> 37:18.170
I was worried about you before.

37:18.800 --> 37:19.630
I did think about

37:19.630 --> 37:21.430
going to Yujing City to find you.

37:21.550 --> 37:23.320
But firstly, because of the bond contract,

37:23.320 --> 37:25.050
I didn't dare risk your safety.

37:25.230 --> 37:25.830
Secondly,

37:26.000 --> 37:27.670
I had joined the Storm Alliance.

37:27.670 --> 37:29.470
I didn't want to become a traitor

37:30.000 --> 37:31.000
who breaks faith.

37:35.230 --> 37:37.160
Given Elder Lei's attitude today,

37:37.320 --> 37:38.710
it seems that leaving this place

37:38.710 --> 37:39.840
won't be easy at all.

37:44.840 --> 37:45.510
Elder Zhou, you're here.

37:45.510 --> 37:46.570
Hello, Elder Zhou.

37:46.880 --> 37:47.990
Lu Ke is injured.

37:48.150 --> 37:49.550
I've come to check on him.

37:50.440 --> 37:51.390
How do you feel?

37:51.590 --> 37:52.480
You shouldn't have troubled yourself

37:52.480 --> 37:53.800
over such a little injury of mine.

37:53.800 --> 37:54.670
It's not that serious.

37:54.670 --> 37:55.230
I've brought you some

37:55.230 --> 37:56.110
oral medicine.

37:56.440 --> 37:59.570
It'll help with blood circulation
and reduce bruising.

37:59.670 --> 38:00.070
That's great.

38:00.070 --> 38:00.670
Thank you.

38:01.670 --> 38:03.530
It's my fault for being careless.

38:04.230 --> 38:06.320
I should have told you
the rules of this place earlier.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.140
So you

38:07.230 --> 38:07.760
wouldn't have suffered

38:07.760 --> 38:09.290
this physical punishment.

38:09.480 --> 38:10.140
Elder Zhou,

38:10.480 --> 38:11.510
we want to leave.

38:11.590 --> 38:12.440
Is there really no way

38:12.440 --> 38:13.640
to make an exception?

38:14.760 --> 38:16.590
Elder Lei initially agreed to save him

38:16.590 --> 38:18.800
out of respect
for the former Alliance Leader.

38:18.800 --> 38:20.320
Now that he's been saved,

38:20.840 --> 38:22.840
it can be said
Elder Lei has done more than enough.

38:22.840 --> 38:23.670
So how could he possibly

38:23.670 --> 38:25.530
let you break the alliance rules?

38:25.710 --> 38:26.440
You know

38:26.480 --> 38:27.810
Elder Lei's character.

38:28.400 --> 38:30.060
Getting him to change his mind

38:30.550 --> 38:31.810
is next to impossible.

38:32.840 --> 38:33.710
You mean

38:33.960 --> 38:35.190
as long as Elder Lei agrees,

38:35.190 --> 38:36.230
we can leave?

38:39.280 --> 38:39.760
Yes.

38:40.400 --> 38:41.190
In the Storm Alliance,

38:41.190 --> 38:42.630
there are four of us elders,

38:42.630 --> 38:44.690
but really, he calls the shots.

38:44.890 --> 38:46.320
If you stay here,

38:46.320 --> 38:47.320
it won't be so bad.

38:47.440 --> 38:49.150
This place has beautiful scenery,

38:49.150 --> 38:51.750
and most importantly,
it's safe and peaceful.

38:51.800 --> 38:52.730
We have to leave.

38:53.400 --> 38:54.930
There's still so much to do.

38:55.760 --> 38:57.290
Do you really have to leave?

38:58.550 --> 38:59.190
We have to.

39:00.760 --> 39:01.590
I understand.

39:02.000 --> 39:03.070
Where the heart finds peace,

39:03.070 --> 39:05.280
even a humble dwelling becomes paradise.

39:05.280 --> 39:06.670
When the heart is trapped,

39:06.670 --> 39:08.480
even a utopia becomes a cage.

39:09.320 --> 39:11.250
Since you're determined to leave,

39:11.320 --> 39:13.380
I suppose you won't change your mind.

39:15.440 --> 39:16.040
Of course.

39:17.190 --> 39:18.850
That makes things difficult.

39:19.590 --> 39:20.840
I have something to ask,

39:20.840 --> 39:22.570
though I'm not sure if I should.

39:24.190 --> 39:25.520
Please ask, Elder Zhou.

39:25.760 --> 39:26.870
I've long heard

39:27.070 --> 39:29.230
that you're known as
the Killer God of Susha.

39:29.230 --> 39:30.070
You must be someone

39:30.070 --> 39:31.630
who's decisive and ruthless.

39:31.630 --> 39:33.760
Now that you're insisting on leaving,

39:33.880 --> 39:37.030
will you carve a bloody path out?

39:44.190 --> 39:45.630
Elder Zhou, you're worried

39:45.630 --> 39:46.670
that I might go on

39:46.920 --> 39:49.050
a killing spree here in order to leave?

39:53.230 --> 39:54.960
I hope you'll be honest with me.

39:55.380 --> 39:56.480
But don't worry—

39:57.000 --> 39:58.130
whatever you tell me

39:58.150 --> 39:59.480
won't leave this place.

39:59.800 --> 40:00.960
If I wanted to harm you,

40:00.960 --> 40:02.710
I wouldn't have saved you
in the first place.

40:02.710 --> 40:04.480
Please rest assured, Elder Zhou.

40:04.480 --> 40:06.340
The Storm Alliance saved my life.

40:06.510 --> 40:07.640
I won't kill anyone.

40:12.550 --> 40:13.480
Do you mean that?

40:13.800 --> 40:15.000
Not even those in the alliance

40:15.000 --> 40:16.400
who hate you to the core

40:16.510 --> 40:17.970
and want to take your life—

40:18.280 --> 40:19.540
you will not harm them?

40:20.030 --> 40:20.830
That's right.

40:21.320 --> 40:22.380
I'm a man of my word.

40:23.280 --> 40:24.150
In that case,

40:25.110 --> 40:26.240
then I can rest easy.

40:42.110 --> 40:42.840
How did it go?

40:42.950 --> 40:44.350
I've already tested him.

40:44.440 --> 40:45.070
Feng Suige

40:45.110 --> 40:46.640
won't agree to kill Lei Lie.

40:48.150 --> 40:49.550
I don't understand either.

40:49.550 --> 40:51.440
This guy carries a deep blood feud.

40:51.440 --> 40:52.480
He should stop at nothing

40:52.480 --> 40:53.360
for revenge.

40:53.480 --> 40:55.150
He shouldn't have hesitated at all

40:55.150 --> 40:56.840
to kill Lei Lie,
who has a grudge against him.

40:56.840 --> 40:57.500
It turns out

40:57.550 --> 40:59.360
I had completely misjudged him.

41:00.230 --> 41:00.840
Zhou Hao,

41:01.550 --> 41:02.070
you promised

41:02.070 --> 41:03.230
to help me get revenge.

41:03.230 --> 41:03.920
Even if your plan

41:03.920 --> 41:04.880
to use Feng Suige falls through,

41:04.880 --> 41:06.320
you absolutely can't go back on your word.

41:06.320 --> 41:07.880
Then you can't hesitate anymore.

41:07.880 --> 41:10.230
We can only  kill Lei Lie ourselves.

41:12.510 --> 41:14.920
What are you still thinking about?
We're running out of time!

41:14.920 --> 41:16.630
Feng Suige has only just recovered

41:16.630 --> 41:18.160
and is still somewhat weak.

41:18.360 --> 41:18.920
Dongshi,

41:19.360 --> 41:21.080
if we don't kill him now,

41:21.110 --> 41:22.280
once he fully recovers,

41:22.280 --> 41:23.810
we won't be able to kill him.

41:27.510 --> 41:30.110
You kill Lei Lie
and take control of the alliance,

41:30.110 --> 41:31.970
and I'll help you kill Feng Suige.

41:35.800 --> 41:37.400
I can't wait any longer!

41:39.960 --> 41:41.960
With my talents in both strategy
and combat,

41:41.960 --> 41:42.440
how could I possibly

41:42.440 --> 41:43.820
live in these mountains

41:44.230 --> 41:45.540
and never get out?

41:46.800 --> 41:48.240
Since you won't help me,

41:48.550 --> 41:49.670
I'll do it myself!

41:50.800 --> 41:51.670
But there's one thing

41:51.670 --> 41:52.800
I need to remind you of.

41:52.800 --> 41:54.730
Once Feng Suige leaves this place,

41:55.070 --> 41:55.840
you will never

41:55.840 --> 41:58.640
have another chance for revenge
in your lifetime.

42:02.960 --> 42:04.000
Can you swear...

42:05.440 --> 42:06.840
that you'll definitely kill him?

42:06.840 --> 42:07.710
Of course.

42:08.590 --> 42:10.320
Your enemy is my enemy.

42:13.360 --> 42:13.840
Good.

42:15.480 --> 42:16.280
When do we act?

42:16.760 --> 42:18.510
Tonight.

42:24.550 --> 42:26.110
His Majesty specifically ordered

42:26.110 --> 42:27.590
that all the dowry sent from Susha

42:27.590 --> 42:29.050
be given to Your Highness.

42:35.710 --> 42:37.370
This servant takes his leave.

42:53.900 --> 42:55.780
♪ Flying alone ♪

42:55.480 --> 42:57.190
If your future husband ever dares to
mistreat you,

42:56.270 --> 42:59.140
♪ With no need for direction ♪

42:57.590 --> 42:58.480
come tell me.

42:58.920 --> 43:00.650
I'll teach him a lesson for you.

43:00.710 --> 43:02.970
I'll always be your support.

43:01.470 --> 43:03.600
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

43:03.280 --> 43:04.400
All of Susha

43:04.200 --> 43:06.640
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

43:04.710 --> 43:05.960
stands behind you.

43:07.030 --> 43:08.590
This is what I specially prepared for you:

43:08.590 --> 43:09.790
a hundred-year-old walnut tree.

43:09.220 --> 43:10.920
♪ Roaming freely ♪

43:10.110 --> 43:10.920
It symbolizes

43:11.230 --> 43:12.620
a harmonious marriage
that will last 100 years.

43:11.470 --> 43:14.650
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

43:16.670 --> 43:18.500
♪ The wet wings ♪

43:18.890 --> 43:23.350
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

43:21.550 --> 43:22.410
Your Highness!

43:25.530 --> 43:26.360
Your Highness...

43:26.180 --> 43:29.460
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

43:32.110 --> 43:36.890
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪
